{"context":{"after":[],"before":[{"id":"seg-000079-5629cc484fbb","source":"moves quickly. The best approach is"},{"id":"seg-000080-7494e64479e1","source":"hands-on. Experiment with different AI"}]},"items":[{"id":"seg-000081-b852d1da539c","source":"systems as often as you can and develop"},{"id":"seg-000082-2d02ef3fe978","source":"your own insights based on personal"},{"id":"seg-000083-f42352aac6c0","source":"experience. We call this second concept"},{"id":"seg-000084-db6bcb000cbc","source":"platform awareness. A working knowledge"},{"id":"seg-000085-0d000684418d","source":"of available AI systems and their"},{"id":"seg-000086-6d4f2895df81","source":"specific capabilities and"},{"id":"seg-000087-61cd95e30e4e","source":"limitations. Once you understand both"},{"id":"seg-000088-3fda8a51582f","source":"your problem and the available AI"},{"id":"seg-000089-0982c3ba3573","source":"assistance, the real art of delegation"},{"id":"seg-000090-f945e297cb96","source":"emerges. thoughtfully distributing work"},{"id":"seg-000091-f6002f241b28","source":"between human and artificial"},{"id":"seg-000092-01d52d3898a2","source":"intelligence to leverage the unique"},{"id":"seg-000093-41a1e2ee68bf","source":"strengths of each. Ask"},{"id":"seg-000094-20a67676e319","source":"yourself which specific parts of your"},{"id":"seg-000095-44fc2d2be990","source":"workflow would benefit from"},{"id":"seg-000096-877f2a8e5fea","source":"automation or where would an"},{"id":"seg-000097-98f8890ccc53","source":"augmentation approach create more value"},{"id":"seg-000098-b9ef4d96a8bc","source":"than either working alone or fully"},{"id":"seg-000099-23779ee5b824","source":"automating? Are there critical judgment"},{"id":"seg-000100-3862ff39a759","source":"areas that should remain exclusively"},{"id":"seg-000101-2a3e32acfc75","source":"human and shouldn't be delegated at all?"},{"id":"seg-000102-a077d1eb121a","source":"What routine interactions can AI agents"},{"id":"seg-000103-9416b18d1856","source":"handle on your behalf? With a clear"},{"id":"seg-000104-381020626472","source":"understanding of both your problem and"},{"id":"seg-000105-978f215832da","source":"available AI systems, you can make"},{"id":"seg-000106-f66afc1863c3","source":"informed decisions about which aspects"},{"id":"seg-000107-17794c1c4350","source":"of work should be automated by AI or"},{"id":"seg-000108-34aadfd4b081","source":"completed through human AI"},{"id":"seg-000109-94f9ca4f4fc8","source":"collaboration or reserved exclusively"},{"id":"seg-000110-1b59f9a36ab5","source":"for human execution or handled by AI"},{"id":"seg-000111-5c5bfbc11385","source":"agents acting on your behalf. We call"},{"id":"seg-000112-846ba3a49df2","source":"this third concept task delegation. The"},{"id":"seg-000113-98782ec51a52","source":"strategic process of dividing work"},{"id":"seg-000114-52e4eca83ac2","source":"between humans and"},{"id":"seg-000115-7744304cc3f4","source":"AI. To recap, delegation involves three"},{"id":"seg-000116-e1347d3c6839","source":"key elements. Problem awareness,"},{"id":"seg-000117-8ad0b8d8e391","source":"understanding your goals and the problem"},{"id":"seg-000118-9200f50100c2","source":"to be solved. Platform awareness,"},{"id":"seg-000119-a222684a468b","source":"understanding AI capabilities and"},{"id":"seg-000120-ba7e3f5c35d2","source":"limitations. And task delegation,"},{"id":"seg-000121-7fd8ab39aec0","source":"strategically dividing the work."},{"id":"seg-000122-21389263df22","source":"This competency highlights something"},{"id":"seg-000123-24429a77746c","source":"important. Effective AI collaboration"},{"id":"seg-000124-bcfcdd7f5af6","source":"isn't about handing over the wheel and"},{"id":"seg-000125-f52b0e898673","source":"calling it a day. It's about making"},{"id":"seg-000126-b179cbbd4ce5","source":"thoughtful choices and delegating work"},{"id":"seg-000127-a5da9c442ded","source":"that leverages the unique strengths of"},{"id":"seg-000128-4c1e249d8b30","source":"both human and artificial intelligence."}],"output_fields":["id","translation"],"source_language":"en-orig","target_language":"zh-CN","translation_contract_version":4}
